# Files in this repo that should NOT be served as part of the public site.
#
# The repo is public (that is fine — nothing secret is in it), but there
# is no reason to publish server source or CI config at a URL.

worker/
.github/
docs/
node_modules/
package.json
package-lock.json
wrangler.jsonc
.assetsignore
.gitignore
README.md

# NEVER publish local development state. `.dev.vars` holds the local
# copies of INSTRUCTOR_PASSWORD and AUTH_SECRET; it is gitignored, so a
# deploy from GitHub never sees it, but `wrangler deploy` run from a
# laptop would otherwise serve it at /.dev.vars in plain text. A leaked
# AUTH_SECRET lets anyone forge an instructor token.
.dev.vars
.dev.vars.*
.wrangler/
.git/
.claude/

# tests/ IS intentionally published: tests/visual-check.html is a useful
# pre-class tool for checking a theme reads on the projector.

# The master copy of the home page video. The site serves the compressed
# 720p version (media/home-loop.mp4, ~11 MB); publishing the 19 MB master
# alongside it would put a file nobody links to on the public site, and
# it is close to Cloudflare's 25 MiB per-asset ceiling.
media/source/
